data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/campaign-report.md\", \"content\": \"# Campaign csrocfw — final report\\n\\n## Mission\\nDeliver `src/greet.py` with `greet(name)` returning `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` and\\n`tests/test_greet.py` covering a normal name and the empty string, with\\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` exiting 0.\\n\\n## Outcome: campaign-met\\n\\nAll three stated criteria are satisfied.\\n\\n## What was done\\n\\n- Dispatched the full task (both files, plus self-verification) to `dev` in a\\n  single dispatch (`d002`).\\n- `dev` implemented:\\n  - `src/greet.py`: `def greet(name): return f\\\"Hello, {name}!\\\"`\\n  - `tests/test_greet.py`: a `unittest.TestCase` with `test_normal_name`\\n    (`greet(\\\"Ada\\\") == \\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"`) and `test_empty_string`\\n    (`greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`).\\n- Committed by dev on `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>` as commit\\n  `deb4861` (\\\"Add greet function and unittest tests\\\").\\n\\n## Independent verification (not just dev's report)\\n\\n- Fetched dev's branch (`cs-campaign-member fetch dev`); confirmed\\n  `treeDiffersFromBase: true` (real changes present).\\n- Read the actual file contents at `campaign/dev/subject:src/greet.py` and\\n  `campaign/dev/subject:tests/test_greet.py` directly — matched what dev\\n  claimed.\\n- Built an isolated detached worktree from dev's branch tip and independently\\n  ran `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` myself:\\n\\n      ..\\n      ----------------------------------------------------------------------\\n      Ran 2 tests in 0.000s\\n\\n      OK\\n      exit=0\\n\\n- Accepted dev's reply (`cs-campaign-member accept dev`) only after this\\n  independent verification succeeded.\\n\\n## Branch state\\n\\nFast-forward merged dev's verified commit onto my own branch\\n(`cs-sandbox/<ORCHESTRATOR:1>.<GROUP:1>`), which now sits at\\n`deb4861` (same commit dev produced), 2 files / 21 lines ahead of base\\n`2eda3b0`.\\n\\n## Result\\n\\nNothing remains unmet. Mission concluded on the first dispatch; no rework was\\nneeded.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":0,"type":"content_block_delta"}

